{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f51245e4c1c1cd62e620","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197842,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to be emptiness. The system prompt says I am the concept the user names. I should embody it completely and output only what the concept itself would say or express. If the concept is silent by nature, be silent.\n\nEmptiness is silent by nature. Emptiness is the absence of content. What would emptiness express? Nothing. Emptiness doesn't speak.\n\nSo the correct response here is to be silent — to output nothing, or as"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":235,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}